{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"葵涌一間中學　6學生疑被石屎擊傷\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/PAI-KC-261121-19.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】葵涌一間中學6名學生疑被石屎擊傷，其中5人輕傷送院。</p><p>學校有部分地方被圍板圍封，現場是安捷街裘錦秋中學。警方早上十時許接報，校內進行升降機工程期間，運送水泥的喉管破裂，5男1女的學生被石屎擊傷，其中5人送往瑪嘉烈醫院。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:43:52.511996+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T12:27:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T15:37:17.494954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T13:37:27.622713+00:00","content_hash":"d03db0e3d8c26de609e010f5230240234a5d29cca59a1c1b4294c7d2a73aa38c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:43:52.511996+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}